  "body": "## What Happens\n\nOn the tool Profile tab with Custom selected, Camcraft validates the holder draft two times in each frame. The preview code validates it once. The section code validates it a second time.\n\n## Why This Is a Problem\n\nThe frame target is under 10 ms (#2238). Derived data must be precalculated and cached, not computed each frame. Duplicate validation in each frame repeats work.\n\nPR #2670 states this in its body under \"What was not exercised\".\n\n## What Should Happen\n\nValidate the draft one time in each frame. Keep the result and share it between the preview and the section code. Use a content stamp to find a changed draft.\n\n## Source\n\nPR #2670 review, 2026-11-19. The duplicate validation is in `preview_inputs` and the section draw code in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/`.\n",
